        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"gpt-image-2-2026-04-21\",\n  \"images\": [\n    {\n      \"image_url\": \"{{ $json.url_input }}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"prompt\": \"Improve only the photographic quality of this real-estate photo. Correct exposure, white balance, color cast, contrast, noise, compression artifacts and recoverable lack of sharpness. Preserve exactly the factual content of the property. Do not add, remove, replace, move or redesign objects, furniture, fixtures or architectural elements. Preserve geometry, materials, textures, structural defects, stains, cracks, wear, clutter, text and the view through windows or openings. Do not declutter, stage, redecorate or repair the property. Do not change camera viewpoint, framing or crop. If a defect cannot be corrected without inventing detail, leave it unchanged.\",\n  \"quality\": \"medium\",\n  \"size\": \"auto\",\n  \"output_format\": \"png\",\n  \"n\": 1\n}",
